X-Moto browser build
====================

X-Moto is free software, licensed under the GNU GPL version 2 or later. See
COPYING.txt.

Built from commit:
@COMMIT@

xmoto-source.tar.gz in this directory holds that source, minus the game data
(bin/), which is unchanged from the repository.

Libraries compiled into the build: ODE, Chipmunk, Lua, bzip2, libccd, md5sum and
xdgbasedir (in the source's vendor/ directory), libxml2 2.13.9 (web/build-deps.sh
downloads it), and Emscripten's ports of SDL2, SDL2_mixer, SDL2_ttf, SDL2_net,
libpng, libjpeg, zlib, sqlite3, ogg, vorbis, freetype and harfbuzz.
